flowchart LR
  CRON[Cron mingguan / tombol admin] --> FETCH[Fetch allowlist .go.id]
  FETCH --> LLM[LLM ringkas JSON + kutip wajib]
  LLM -->|error / JSON invalid| RUNFAIL[(studio_research_runs failed/partial)]
  LLM --> VAL[Validasi substring kutip]
  VAL --> DEDUPE[Embedding vs match_studio_chunks]
  DEDUPE -->|embed gagal| UNCHK[dedupe_unchecked flag]
  DEDUPE -->|OK| PENDING[(studio_research_items pending)]
  UNCHK --> PENDING
  PENDING --> ADMIN[Admin Riset Knowledge super_admin]
  ADMIN -->|Approve| MERGE[addTextSource + ingestSource]
  ADMIN -->|Reject| REJ[rejected]
  MERGE --> NB[(KASIR_CONSULT_NOTEBOOK_ID)]
  ADMIN -->|Unmerge| DEL[removeSource + approved]
